{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5a7d76d6-0e54-899d-8973-65161e1f18af",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:16:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ricardo Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:11:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Happy Monday, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:11:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Beth. Good afternoon. My name is Ricardo Pagan. I am calling because I want to know about the pickleball at the gym. The times, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:11:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to help with that. Are you looking for open play, or something more like a class or a league?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:12:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Open play, I think. Just to play with other people. I am new to this game. A friend told me it is very good for the, how do you say, the joints. Not so hard on the knees."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:12:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a great one for that. So for the winter, we have open play indoors at the gym. Let me pull up the schedule here. Give me one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:12:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, take your time. I am not in a hurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:12:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so right now it looks like it's weekday mornings and a couple of evenings. Tuesday and Thursday evenings, starting at six. And then mornings are Monday, Wednesday, Friday, from nine until eleven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nine until eleven in the morning. And the evening, Tuesday and Thursday, at six. Let me write this down. [pause] Okay. Is it the same gym for both?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:13:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same gym, yep. It's the community gym. You'd just come in through the main entrance and check in at the desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:13:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And when does it start? The first day, I mean. Is it already going, or it starts later?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:13:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The winter session is just getting going. The mornings are already running. The evening ones, let me look. [pause] Those start this Thursday, so the fourth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:13:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This Thursday, the fourth. Okay, that is very close. And I need to sign up before, or I just arrive?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:13:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For open play, you generally just show up. But there's a short form you fill out the first time, and you'd need that before you can play."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:13:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A farm? Like a farm with animals? Sorry, I do not understand. I am not a farmer, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:13:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, not a farm. A form. Like a paper form, with your name and your contact information. A sheet you sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:14:07-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, a form, with the m. Okay, okay. I heard farms, with the s. My ears, they are still learning. Excuse me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:14:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all, it's an easy one to mix up on the phone. It takes about two minutes. You can do it at the desk when you get there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:14:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So I bring nothing, only myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:14:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pretty much. Sneakers with non-marking soles, so they don't scuff the gym floor. Paddles, I believe, they have some to borrow, but if you have your own you can bring it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:14:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not have a paddle yet. I will borrow the first time. Is there a price? A fee for the open play?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check on that. [pause] Okay, it's listed on the schedule. There's a small drop-in charge for each visit, and the desk can tell you exactly when you arrive. I don't want to give you the wrong number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:15:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is fine. I will ask at the desk. And the morning on Monday, today, it is already finished, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:15:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, today's morning session ended at eleven. So the next one is Wednesday at nine, or the Thursday evening at six if you want the first evening night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:15:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think I will go Thursday evening. Six o'clock. Maybe more people, more fun for a beginner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:15:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like a plan. Do you want me to put your name down as someone interested, so the staff expects you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:15:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Ricardo Pagan. Pagan, P-A-G-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:15:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Ricardo Pagan. And a phone number in case the schedule changes, like for weather?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:16:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0184."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:16:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, 401-555-0184. I've got you down for Thursday evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:16:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Beth. You were very clear. Now I know the times, and the day it starts, and the form, with the m."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:16:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Enjoy your first game, and have a good afternoon!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T14:16:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
